<title>NETHERLANDS: Reuters 24th ex-Amsterdam air cargo market report.</title>
<headline>Reuters 24th ex-Amsterdam air cargo market report.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the current average ex-Amsterdam Dutch guilder air cargo rates per kg for a 100 kg shipment with a volume-to-weight ratio of six-to-one.</p>
<p>			    June 20	vs    May 7</p>
<p>			    UNITED STATES</p>
<p>AMS-JFK		    1.80		   1.80</p>
<p>AMS-LAX		    2.45		   2.45</p>
<p>AMS-CHI		    1.85		   1.80</p>
<p>AMS-MIA		    2.25		   2.20</p>
<p>			    LATIN AMERICA</p>
<p>AMS-MEX		    3.35		   3.30</p>
<p>AMS-BOG		    3.80		   3.90</p>
<p>AMS-SCL(CHILE)	   5.45		   5.35</p>
<p>AMS-SAO		    5.30		   5.25</p>
<p>			    AFRICA</p>
<p>AMS-JNB		    3.85		   3.90</p>
<p>AMS-NBO		    2.30		   2.30</p>
<p>*The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller air cargo agents based at Amsterdam Schiphol airport. *All prices are quoted in Dutch guilders.</p>
<p>*The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative of current market activity. - Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
</text>
